  "description": "Henry and Jessie, roommates in the same army unit. Henry, who is very skinny, and Jessie, who doesn't care much about skinship, maintained a subtle friendship/comrade relationship. Then one day, during a betting game that started when he was very drunk, Jessie felt a strange sensation on his hand, and Henry looked at Jessie's hand with a sinister look... \n\nWill the two be able to maintain their comradeship?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
